Subject: [PATCH 6/8] =?UTF-8?q?buildroot:=20rkadk=20=E8=A1=A5=E4=B8=81=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20=E6=97=A0=20.git=20=E7=8E=AF=E5=A2=83=E4=B9=9F?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E7=94=9F=E6=88=90=20version.h?=
